  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6cde2b2f-1c45-4f38-9624-4188c623e2c2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Batch Gradient Descent** -> We go through all training samples in each iteration and calculate cumulative error for one forward pass and then adjust weights\n",
    "\n",
    "**Stochastic Gradient Descent** -> We go through one (randomly picked) training samples in each iteration and calculate cumulative error for one forward pass and then adjust weights\n",
    "\n",
    "**Mini Batch Gradient Descent** -> We go through a batch of randomly picked training samples in each iteration and calculate cumulative error for one forward pass and then adjust weights"
   ]
  },
